- [useDeliveries](https://ably.com/docs/ai-transport/api/react/use-deliveries.md?source=llms.txt): API reference for the AI Transport useDeliveries hook: receive every delivery on the transport's channel while a component is mounted.
- [useHistory](https://ably.com/docs/ai-transport/api/react/use-history.md?source=llms.txt): API reference for the AI Transport useHistory hook: read the channel's history one page at a time, oldest first.
- [useTransportStatus](https://ably.com/docs/ai-transport/api/react/use-transport-status.md?source=llms.txt): API reference for the AI Transport useTransportStatus hook: observe the transport's discontinuities and errors.
- [useTransport](https://ably.com/docs/ai-transport/api/react/use-transport.md?source=llms.txt): API reference for the AI Transport useTransport hook: read the transport from the nearest or a named TransportProvider.
- [OpenAI codec](https://ably.com/docs/ai-transport/api/javascript/openai/codec.md?source=llms.txt): API reference for the AI Transport codec for the OpenAI Responses API: openai, createOpenAICodec, and the OpenAIEvent union of Responses stream events and client input.
- [AG-UI codec](https://ably.com/docs/ai-transport/api/javascript/ag-ui/codec.md?source=llms.txt): API reference for the AI Transport codec for AG-UI: agui, createAGUICodec, and the AGUIEvent union of AG-UI events and the run-input a client sends.
- [Codec](https://ably.com/docs/ai-transport/api/javascript/transport/codec.md?source=llms.txt): API reference for the AI Transport Codec: the encode and decode contract a transport uses, EncodedMessage, and how defineCodec builds a codec from a table of event rows.
- [Transport](https://ably.com/docs/ai-transport/api/javascript/transport/transport.md?source=llms.txt): API reference for the AI Transport Transport: createTransport, send, pipe, subscribe with history replay, fromSerial, untilEvent, history, discontinuity and error events, and close.
- [Vercel codec](https://ably.com/docs/ai-transport/api/javascript/vercel/codec.md?source=llms.txt): API reference for the AI Transport codec for the Vercel AI SDK: vercel, createVercelCodec, and the VercelEvent union of UIMessageChunk events and the user message.

